318 0 obj
<</Dest [203 0 R /XYZ 71.945 137.031372 0] /Parent 316 0 R /Prev 319 0 R /SE 202 0 R /Title (While much of the industry is focused on whether these arrangements violate the newly expanded General Anti-Avoidance Rule \(GAAR\), there is a much more immediate, mechanical compliance risk. Based on a strict reading of the mathematical definitions in the Income Tax Act \(ITA\), it appears that certain leveraged life insurance structures may technically qualify as tax shelters. Advisors and corporate policyholders must carefully evaluate this risk. ) >>
endobj

